WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.760
Today we are launching

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.440
a major new program
by Gazprom,

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.960
the large-scale development

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:54.080
of the Kharasavey gas field,
in the Yamal peninsula.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.440
The world of energy is a fascinating one.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.400
Perhaps because people are capable of the worst in order to get into it.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:06.720
Who gets hold of energy gets hold of power.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:08.800
In today's world,

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:11.520
Russia is the largest gas producer.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.760
Yamal contains 80%

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.600
of Russia's reserves.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.520
And at this gas-safe deposit box,

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.440
I met the Nenets.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:49.280
The Nenets are born in nature,
we are part of nature.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:56.800
Without reindeer,
a Nenet is no longer a Nenet.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.560
Will the Nanettes survive gas development?

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.040
Will their way of life suffer?

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.000
What's the impact on their environment?

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:32.200
In Yamal,

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:37.960
the Nanettes perpetuate from generation to generation the longest transhuman's route in the world.

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.200
Scattered in some 50 brigades,

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.040
called so since the Soviet era,

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.960
the Nanets live entirely off their livestock,

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.080
reindeer meat and skins.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:55.520
In the tundra,

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.520
I followed two brigades,

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:07.640
number one and number four.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:24.160
Every day of our life
depends on the weather.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:28.880
We are constantly
searching for lichen,

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:32.480
and that is what spurs
our migration.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.880
Vasili Seroteto is the patriarch of Brigade Number One.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:46.120
He guides his herd of over 2,000 reindeer during a heroic journey.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.600
In the Nenets language,

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.280
Yamal means the end of the world.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:32.000
The Siberian peninsula located north of the Arctic Circle is 700 kilometers long,

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.800
a quarter of the surface of France.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.080
From spring onwards,

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:42.280
the Nenets lead their herds to the north on the shores of the Kara Sea.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:46.400
They search for the fresh air and rich pastures of the tundra.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:55.360
In winter they head south through the frozen Ob,

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.040
one of the largest Russian rivers.

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:02.280
They leave the tundra for the taiga,

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.040
the boreal forest.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.640
The tundra is everything to me.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.960
We migrate
towards the Kara Sea.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:34.720
We are sometimes on the move
for three days in a row.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.760
We rest for a day,

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:40.720
then we travel
three days in a row.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.120
We will continue to migrate.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:46.320
It's the only life I know.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:10.680
It all started 50 years ago when Soviet geologists made a discovery that would change the lives of the Nenets.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:15.760
The Kharasavey gas field
was discovered in 1974.

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:16.000
APA

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.720
By the following year,

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:21.600
it was designated
objective number one

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:24.080
in the Yamal Peninsula.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.800
Work was undertaken
with enthusiasm.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:30.000
The permafrost
and the icy Arctic winds

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.360
caused the drillers and builders
serious problems.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:37.040
The works got bogged down
and were abandoned in 1981.

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:41.520
The Yamal Peninsula
was beyond the reach of the USSR.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:53.200
They built this drilling platform
in 1982.

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:57.840
They were looking for gas
and they found it.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:02.960
In 1984,
they built a port.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.360
It lasted a year.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:09.200
As the bay
wasn't deep enough,

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.720
they decided
to dig a canal.

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:17.760
Following a storm
and flooding,

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:21.280
everything was submerged.

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:26.000
You see,
nature does not tolerate that.

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.160
She floods everything.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.240
The fruit of two weeks of work

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.280
was swept away by nature
in just one night.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:36.640
It happens.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.080
Nothing discourages the Russian authorities,

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:48.160
neither the complexity of gas exploitation,

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:51.680
nor the extreme climate conditions of Yamal.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.880
Industrialization can start.

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:28.200
For generations,

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:28.840
Brigade No.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.960
4 passed through the Bovenenkovo area,

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:33.200
now the dominion of Gazprom,

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:35.840
the heart of gas exploitation.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:40.400
Over the years,

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:43.520
Mian Gehudi has seen the tundra change dramatically.

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:48.880
When I was your age,

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:53.360
my father and grandfather
migrated along this path.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:56.320
They taught me the route.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:04.640
One day, on this mound,
we spotted a covered sled.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:08.800
They were geologists,

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.760
explorers searching for gas.

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:16.640
There used to be nothing here.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:18.960
Look, son.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.920
We would set up our camps
down there.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.680
Those pipes weren't there.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.240
Now we have
to pass under the pipes.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:32.560
We used to migrate over there,
on dry land.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:38.480
But it's getting difficult
to migrate these days.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.560
Want to use the land and the towns are growing and 

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.840
and and that is that is a real pressure

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:16.360
and there is no way to invent these pastures somewhere else.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:26.640
When I was 17,

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:30.320
I saw machines
drilling for gas.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:33.280
Everything was covered in sand.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.000
They were prospecting
all over the place.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:40.960
I saw reindeer tracks

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.320
covered in sand.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.840
I thought:
"If I don't educate myself,

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:53.440
I won't be able
to help my parents.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:00.320
To ensure the reindeer tracks
don't disappear,

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:03.680
I decided to study.

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:06.120
Alec

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:08.400
Seroteto, son of Vasili,

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:13.600
is one of the few Nenets to have graduated with diplomas in law and economics.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:27.760
He lives in Yars Sali,

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:30.880
in a small town in southeastern Yamal.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.640
I cannot speak for everyone,

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:42.080
only for my community,

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:45.120
my parents,
my brothers.

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:49.200
I bear the responsibility
of being the one who studied.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:57.760
My role is to help them,
to defend their interests.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:02.080
It is a great responsibility.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:12.240
I am an independent contractor.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.560
I have my own business.

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:18.560
I worked in administration
for eight years.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:24.640
I was a fervent political advocate

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:28.960
for the interests
of the indigenous peoples.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:36.000
I stood up
to the oil and gas company.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:40.560
was too independent
for their taste

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:44.400
and so, in 2011,
they fired me.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:08.640
There is growing interest
for the Arctic in the world

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:13.680
and it is a priority for Russia.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:20.160
The development of Russian
infrastructure projects in the Arctic

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:24.640
has begun,
and is actively continuing.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:33.320
Every year Russia organizes an international conference on the oil and gas industry in St.

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:34.040
Petersburg.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:39.560
The entire Russian state elite and apparatus have a single objective

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.760
to become the world's leading energy power.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:47.040
You probably know

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:52.080
that over 80%
of natural gas reserves

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:57.920
and over 20% of oil
are concentrated in the Arctic zone.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:02.000
The Arctic projects
are a priority for us.

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:24.720
The gas extraction process

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:32.320
involves the construction
of infrastructure.

00:14:33.840 --> 00:14:39.200
Before extraction of the gas,
the land has to be prepared,

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:47.200
sand has to be found, digging done.
Water is needed.

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:53.120
Much land becomes
unavailable for grazing

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:56.480
to make way
for drilling machinery.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.160
The preparatory works
cause us many problems.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:10.160
They will extract the gas
until there is none left.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.880
That will take
another 50 to 100 years

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:29.720
Villages are changing into city such as Saleharlt

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.400
or into dormitory towns like Bovonenkovo.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:36.040
Infrastructure is expanding.

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:42.800
Gazprom is building the world's most northerly railway line.

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:46.960
And Novatec,

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:48.280
together with Total,

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:50.960
build an industrial exploitation site.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:52.480
So better.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:59.920
They designed a harbour and an international airport with a direct connection to Moscow.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:14.560
To date, Yamal is the zone
that we know best.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.760
It offers an opportunity to access foreign markets. 

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.760
The gas produced
on the Yamal Peninsula

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:22.400
The gas produced
on the Yamal Peninsula

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:26.960
has been supplied
to South and North America.

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:30.160
Almost all purchasing countries

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:33.600
have received
these gas molecules.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:39.520
One of our current priority tasks

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:46.320
is to take advantage
of these opportunities.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:54.760
In the West,

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:59.720
the Russians have built pipeline networks to transport gas overland into Europe.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:03.360
In the East,

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:05.280
they open a northeastern seaway,

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:07.520
with Yamal as the point of departure.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:12.800
LNG tankers filled with liquid gas are leaving for the West,

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.160
others towards Asia.

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:19.800
However,

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:21.080
from December to April,

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:24.680
this sea route around the Bering Strait is closed.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:28.280
It is covered by more than three meters of thick ice.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:06.960
It is a seaway
that opens us to the world.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:17.760
It is our strength,
we want to transport gas to the East.

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:22.880
To do so,
we need powerful icebreakers.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:27.280
If we take the route
via the Ob-Yenisei Canal,

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:29.280
to the Cape of Zhelaniya,

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:32.960
there are over 1000 km
of pack ice.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:34.240
Lit

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:39.440
And it's 4,500 km
from Yamal to Cape Dezhnyov.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.560
For the first time in history

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:50.640
the Northeast Russian route
will be a seaway

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:03.560
Nuclear ice-breaker criss-cross the ocean

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:08.280
to facilitate the 6000 km strach along the siberian coast

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.800
=

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.920
over the Arctic's raw materials.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:20.560
Slacken it a little here

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:22.200
Vasili has only one concern,

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.680
the survival of his herd and his way of life.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:38.560
Everything related to reindeer
is my responsibility.

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:44.960
If a chief mismanages
such a big brigade,

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.200
if he makes a mistake,

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:53.680
he cannot make up for it
over the course of the year.

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:05.360
If his preparations
for the summer are inadequate,

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.560
he will not succeed in that season.

00:20:11.760 --> 00:20:16.160
After summer comes the fall.

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:20.720
If the chief doesn't work well
in the fall,

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:23.600
he'll have problems.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:47.120
If nothing is ready,
time will be wasted.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:54.080
We could get caught up
in the October snowstorms,

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:59.600
the reindeer could lose
the weight they gained in summer.

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:34.480
If we don't reach
the winter pastures early enough,

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:37.360
we're done for.

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:41.680
The reindeer won't gain weight.

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:52.960
But if we do get there in time,

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:58.640
we let them graze
like wild reindeer.

00:22:00.240 --> 00:22:03.520
If they don't gain weight
during that period,

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:07.920
they'll be thin in spring
and won't bear offspring.

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:31.760
If I do my job badly,

00:22:32.800 --> 00:22:37.680
I won't have top-quality meat
come the fall.

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:44.080
By 2024,

00:22:44.240 --> 00:22:48.480
we plan to transport
80 million tons of goods

00:22:48.640 --> 00:22:51.360
by the Northern Sea Route.

00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:56.080
To maintain this level of traffic,

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:00.160
we need state-of-the-art icebreakers.

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:04.800
The transport of 80 million tons

00:23:05.200 --> 00:23:08.880
makes this a requirement.

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:22.360
A major challenge for icebreakers is to open the seaways to tankers filled with liquefied gas.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:29.120
They leave from the tip of the Ob River to reach Asia in 15 days,

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:32.240
instead of 30 via the Suez Canal.

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:45.720
The Arctic is no longer a sanctuary.

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:51.720
It is being transformed into some 5,500 kilometers long maritime highway.

00:23:52.400 --> 00:23:57.120
Drifting ice
is a major problem for us.

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:04.000
We need to use some new tactics of ice navigation.

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:05.800
New type of work,

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:06.120
you know.

00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:27.360
We have some experience with icebreaker assistance with small ships.

00:24:27.840 --> 00:24:28.960
We know how to lead them,

00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:30.280
we know how to tow them,

00:24:30.800 --> 00:24:33.240
but with such a new type we don't know,

00:24:33.360 --> 00:24:35.040
we don't have such experience.

00:24:35.840 --> 00:24:40.200
And this is the most problem maybe nowadays.

00:24:49.520 --> 00:24:53.960
Usually we can break about one and a half meters,

00:24:54.680 --> 00:24:55.680
sometimes two meters,

00:24:55.720 --> 00:24:57.600
we can go through this ICS.

00:25:05.480 --> 00:25:09.640
Our main purpose is to lead the ship as an icebreaker.

00:25:15.880 --> 00:25:24.360
We are going very close to the ship and we break the ice near the ship and that can help to start the move.

00:25:42.240 --> 00:25:44.920
The main problem is that we can go through the ice,

00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:49.280
but the question is if our ship could.

00:25:49.680 --> 00:25:52.120
That ship that we are leading sometimes can't.

00:25:54.920 --> 00:25:59.320
And if we can go through the ice but the ship which we lead can't,

00:25:59.320 --> 00:26:01.440
the main purpose is not completed.

00:26:05.680 --> 00:26:10.320
Up until now,
ten LNG tankers

00:26:10.560 --> 00:26:13.200
were operating
in the Arctic Circle.

00:26:13.520 --> 00:26:16.400
The plan is
to increase that number to 30

00:26:16.800 --> 00:26:21.280
How do you think
you will assist 30 LNG tankers

00:26:21.680 --> 00:26:25.280
not to mention
the other vessels?

00:26:25.680 --> 00:26:29.520
Three first-class
nuclear icebreakers

00:26:29.680 --> 00:26:33.360
will not be enough
for such an amount of work.

00:26:42.720 --> 00:26:46.000
Obviously,
the Nenets are not happy.

00:26:46.240 --> 00:26:50.240
Production has been launched.
It's inevitable.

00:26:51.520 --> 00:26:55.040
They don't try to prevent it,

00:26:55.520 --> 00:26:57.520
set it on fire,

00:26:57.760 --> 00:27:00.720
or sabotage anything.

00:27:00.960 --> 00:27:03.840
But they complain.

00:27:06.800 --> 00:27:12.400
My own feeling is
that it's impossible to stop it.

00:27:13.920 --> 00:27:19.200
The machine is launched,
and it's advancing.

00:27:34.080 --> 00:27:38.640
The oil and gas industry
has been active for 30 years.

00:27:39.360 --> 00:27:45.760
The transformation
must be reasonable,

00:27:47.440 --> 00:27:50.560
so that it doesn't eradicate

00:27:50.880 --> 00:27:55.760
that which has preceded it
for many centuries.

00:27:56.240 --> 00:27:59.440
The main field
being worked today

00:27:59.600 --> 00:28:01.680
is that in Bovanenkovo.

00:28:02.320 --> 00:28:06.800
Sabetta-Yamal is operated
by Gazprom Dobycha Nadym.

00:28:08.320 --> 00:28:12.720
Gazprom Neft Yamal operates
the Novyi Port field.

00:28:13.040 --> 00:28:16.160
The gas leaves
from Mys Kamennyi

00:28:16.400 --> 00:28:19.840
in tankers
and is transported abroad.

00:28:20.320 --> 00:28:22.960
The icebreakers
patrol all year round.

00:28:23.360 --> 00:28:27.600
They break the ice
for the tankers they assist.

00:28:38.200 --> 00:28:38.320
In

00:28:38.320 --> 00:28:39.200
the Gulf of the Ob,

00:28:39.480 --> 00:28:40.800
the crossing is narrow.

00:28:43.200 --> 00:28:45.560
The icebreakers are patrolling all the time.

00:28:53.360 --> 00:28:55.600
The most difficult period

00:28:55.760 --> 00:28:59.440
in the Gulf of Ob
is end of March, early April.

00:29:03.280 --> 00:29:06.560
and is at its thickest.

